  "details": "I used to have a 2060 super and got around 60 fps with it. Yesterady i got the rtx 4080 and tested it in vr and desktop. In vr and desktop mode i dont get much more fps than with the 2060s but in vr i can set my resolution to 6000 x 6500 and still have 60 fps but i cant get more than 60 fps (with low resolution). It just sets the fps limit to 60fps. If this is a vrchat bug please try looking into this and if its a driver bug or something else please contact me so i know what the problem is. (only in vrchat low fps) My graphics card and cpu are only at 25% usage when playing idk if the game can use more or not.",
